  "meta": {
    "description": "Sprint 10 — I-1: Calendly invitee.created → resolve booking context via /api/enrollments/by-calendly-invitee (returns session_booking_id, student, tutor, session title, scheduled_start, duration, timezone) → mint Zoom S2S token → POST Zoom meeting → persist meeting_link via /api/webhooks/n8n (type: meeting_created, session_booking_id) → send student confirmation via /api/n8n/notify (template: session_booking_confirmed) and tutor notification (type: email_tutor). Documented in n8n/docs/WORKFLOWS.md §2.2."
